  "modmenu.summaryTranslation.domestia_vendor_choice": "Owner-protected vending, storage, Vendor Notes, and logistics.",
  "modmenu.descriptionTranslation.domestia_vendor_choice": "Domestia Vendor Choice adds owner-protected Vendor Machines, Vendor Safes, Vendor Notes, and Vendor Hoppers for multiplayer survival worlds. Vendor Machines support configurable stock, prices, protected vault storage, front item display, sales UI feedback, vanilla sound effects, and owner-only control access. Vendor Safes provide private barrel-style storage with owner-only access and administrative recovery rules. Vendor Notes provide owner-edited public notices for shops and shared spaces. Vendor Hoppers provide owner-aware item logistics for protected vendor systems. Source code and issue tracking are available on GitHub: https://github.com/domestia-mods/domestia-vendor-choice. If this mod made your server a little better, buy me a coffee: https://ko-fi.com/Z5X220SWVK",
